1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,586
Poora din photo kheenchta hoon, par koi paise nahi deta.

2
00:00:03,886 --> 00:00:07,827
Ajay bhai, teri photo kamaal ki hain! Photo studio khol le!

3
00:00:08,127 --> 00:00:10,588
Camera, light, sab bahut mehnga hai yaar.

4
00:00:10,888 --> 00:00:15,616
Second-hand camera, do light, backdrop aur printer. Dedh lakh mein setup.

5
00:00:15,916 --> 00:00:21,364
Passport photo se roz ka kharcha nikaal. Asli kamai shaadi aur event mein hai.

6
00:00:21,914 --> 00:00:26,458
Puttar, mere bete ki shaadi hai! Photo ekdum filmy chahiye!

7
00:00:26,758 --> 00:00:31,060
Photo, video aur album. Poora package 40 hazaar, Sardar ji!

8
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:35,303
Season mein mahine ki 3-4 shaadiyan, 80 hazaar se upar!

9
00:00:35,603 --> 00:00:41,220
Instagram pe reels daal. Aur pre-wedding shoot bech, wahan sabse zyada paisa hai.

10
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:44,441
Ajay Photo Studio, click ho gaya! Life set!
